    "detailed_description": "<strong>Hornet Virus: Steel Alcimus II</strong> is a sequel of Steel Alcimus inspired by various 1980-1990s' 3D computer games. Pilot Videl air force's deadliest helicopter HCH-960C Super Aicimus in this action-packed 3D game. Destroy the targets, rescue the hostages, and capture the enemy buildings to save the world!<br><br>Features<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Simplistic Arcade helicopter action in Full-3D environments<br></li><li>5 playable helicopters and 14 weapons<br></li><li>Various game modes including 50 single missions, Dynamic campaign, Raid, and Air patrol<br></li><li>Partial controller support (Xinput controller required)</li></ul>",
